 | Key | What it holds |
 | --- | --- |
 | `lines` | one entry per SKU compared, each with `sku`, `counted`, `expected` and `delta` |
+| `checked` | how many SKUs were compared |
+| `delta_total` | the sum of the absolute deltas across every line |
 
 `delta` is `counted - expected`: negative means stock is missing.
 
+A SKU that is expected and was not counted at all is still a line, with
+`counted` 0 and a delta of `-expected`. A pallet that walked off the site is
+what the count exists to catch, so its absence has to be visible.
+
 ## Lines are always ordered by SKU
 
 `lines` comes back sorted by `sku`, ascending, and by nothing else. This is not
